{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:28 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:28 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:28 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ed554a96f9d25ff2ed103dd98b2df2b/2026-10/2a4662a9-748e-4d24-9660-2705322989da_4.jpg\"/><p>油麻地發生屍體發現案。今日（21日）早上11時許，警方接報指一名47歲尼泊爾籍持香港身份證的男子近日失聯，朋友擔心他發生意外於是報警。警方到男子位於佐敦道37號佐敦大廈的寓所調查，發現男子倒卧房間內，當場證實死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定，警方正調查事件原因。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:40:22.857550+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:28:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T15:18:06.327218+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:35.924552+00:00","content_hash":"f2fe0b9f6ec6edafc6c562656ac23a817dae4176c32913cb0c72bcd57dbd1d96","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}